  "schema:name": "P2 · His summary is assembled and signed",
  "schema:description": "Onesa's HIE assembles Kamal's International Patient Summary from his care history: his conditions, his medicines, his allergy. It issues a Verifiable Health Link to it, signs it with a key registered with GDHCN, and puts the QR code in his wallet. Step 2 of the overview of key process flows.",
